&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationship with clients based on trust and credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal account leads on supporting day-day project management through the content, strategy and creative departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in internal and client meetings, presentations, and calls; prepare relevant documents, including agendas, presentation decks and follow up communications, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate copy, layouts, artwork, media plans and productions materials and make suggested revisions in keeping with agreed upon strategies and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep agency team informed of client requests and changes; anticipate potential problems and potential implications; proactively develop and execute solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively contribute to manage project scope and budget; notify manager of client requests that fall outside of scope; alert client of financial and timing implications; secure client approval to proceed and revise budgets as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze program results, summarize findings, and recommend program enhancements and/or changes to improve going forward.&lt;/li&gt;
