&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role is based at our Central Manchester office and follows a hybrid work model.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:150}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
